I have always felt that The Heart of Ahriman is a very poor choice for
the barbarian quest artifact. Why? Because in the original Conan
stories the Heart was not used by Conan himself but always by some
allied wizard. For example, in "Hour of Dragon" it is explicitly
mentioned that only an advanced wizard can use it.

The only plausible non-spellcaster nethack effect that the book's
Heart may have is magic resistance.

I would be in favor of scrapping the Heart completely and by replacing
it by more suitable artifact.


